{"id":"7a453a6b0e34f3a9","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md","title":"Omega Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-omega-incompleteness — Omega Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-omega-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-omega-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-omega-incompleteness — Omega Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-omega-complete]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-omega-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-omega-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-incompleteness — Omega Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic strength for verifying individual proof-code computations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span> (omega-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备性 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a>)</li>\n<li>Gödel证明：一致系统不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备的</li>\n<li>存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>，使每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\)</span>成立，但<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\forall x\\,\\varphi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>可取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(x)\">\\(\\psi(x)\\)</span>表达“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>不是某个固定点句的证明码”；每个标准numeral实例可验证，但其全称闭包不可证</li>\n<li>这是不完备性定理的另一种表述</li>\n<li>普通一致性只是在有效证明检查与足够算术强度仍成立时才给出此结论；任意弱或无效系统不受该式约束</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-complete","status":"resolved","id":"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"9